      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Agreed. more concerning is that many popular groups who host publics refuse to accept vrchat's age verification. Staff from these groups have even repeated the false claim that personas system has been comprimised. I have had this same interaction with 10s of groups and its very concerning.\n\nObviously if such groups were truly concerned about minors entering, they could do manual ID verfication in their discord and host group-only instances.\n\nFor groups that seem to place such a large emphasis on security they seem to be willing to let minors enter their 'adults only' lobby with nothing more than a verbal test.\n\nMany seem more concerned with popularity and getting to play bouncer than keeping their members safe.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
