      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "We do need to make the demanding of private infromation such as DOB against the TOS. It's too easily abused, creates a hostile environment and sets a bad example that it's okay to give out private information publicly for all to hear. Don't forget people get bullied and discriminated against all the time for their age in VRChat.",
