  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Since users are now handing their own data and information over to vrchat and persona not these users that keep asking for users DOB in public lobbies, I am requesting that vrchat enforce this and make it against TOS because some people that have the new verification feature might feel safer if lobbies themselves were moderated as it obviously is healthier for vrchat but not mishandled in the way of asking for users DOB and things that could lead to illegal doxxing, The ethics of someone sat in a doorway while everyone else is enjoying themselves on the game completely destroys the whole objective they should be playing the game and having fun!",
